sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Producing service
  participant B as Event broker
  participant S as Subscribing service
  participant D as Dead-letter queue
  participant O as Owning team on-call
  P->>B: Publish event (envelope, key)
  B-->>P: Accepted, stored for seven days
  B->>S: Deliver (at least once, in order per key)
  alt Subscriber acknowledges
    S-->>B: Acknowledge
  else Subscriber fails or times out
    B->>S: Retry with backoff, up to 10 attempts
    B->>D: Move event to dead-letter
    D-->>O: Alert when depth over 100 for 10 minutes
    O->>B: Replay from dead-letter after the fix
    B->>S: Deliver again
  end
